OL,3,GNEWSAMan impaled on shelf by car,
OL,4,Amurder trial told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man allegedly murdered as part of a
OL,7,Ffeud between families was fatally
OL,8,Fimpaled on a metal shelf when he was
OL,9,Frammed by a car at a petrol station, a
OL,10,Fcourt has heard.
OL,12,FDaniel Ambler, 23, was declared dead at
OL,13,Fthe scene after being struck by a
OL,14,FNissan X-Trail in Seaham, County
OL,15,FDurham, in January, Teesside Crown
OL,16,FCourt heard.
OL,18,FBarry Anderson, 52, and his sons
OL,19,FAshton, 20, and Logan, 19, deny murder.
OL,20,FTwo 18-year-olds, Tyler Leadbetter and
OL,21,FAjay Henry, deny the same charge.
